            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic opens Home the first time each day when Today has a podcast or digest, and otherwise the forum you read last. Links, notifications, Siri and shared pages always open what they point to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“自动”会在每天第一次打开且“今日”有播客或摘要时显示首页，否则打开你上次阅读的论坛。链接、通知、Siri 和分享的页面总是打开它们指向的内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「自動」會在每天第一次打開且「今日」有播客或摘要時顯示首頁，否則打開你上次閱讀的論壇。連結、通知、Siri 和分享的頁面一律打開它們指向的內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic puts it at the bottom on iPhone and in narrow windows, and at the top when the assistant is beside the page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“自动”在 iPhone 和窄窗口中将其放在底部，在助手位于页面旁边时放在顶部。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「自動」在 iPhone 和窄視窗中將其放在底部，在助理位於頁面旁邊時放在頂部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic reads posts aloud while headphones are connected; otherwise the voice points at the screen. Voice names and styles are Google’s." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“自动”会在连接耳机时朗读帖子；否则语音会请你看屏幕。声音名称和风格来自 Google。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「自動」會在連接耳機時朗讀貼文；否則語音會請你看螢幕。聲音名稱和風格來自 Google。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic uses Google’s voices when you have a Google Gemini or Vertex AI key and have agreed to send the script to Google; otherwise this device’s voices. Nothing is made in the background. The daily switch is kept on this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“自动”在你有 Google Gemini 或 Vertex AI 密钥并同意把脚本发送给 Google 时使用 Google 的声音，否则使用本设备的声音。不会在后台制作。“每天制作”开关只保存在本设备上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「自動」在你有 Google Gemini 或 Vertex AI 金鑰並同意把腳本傳送給 Google 時使用 Google 的聲音，否則使用本裝置的聲音。不會在背景製作。「每天製作」開關只儲存在本裝置上。"
