      }
    },
    "Each chapter is one text-to-speech request, billed to your key or counted against its free quota. This device’s voices are free and offline instead." : {
      "comment" : "Podcast consent: cost",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一章是一次文字转语音请求，费用计入你的密钥，或占用其免费额度。改用本设备的声音则免费且可离线使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一章是一次文字轉語音請求，費用計入你的金鑰，或佔用其免費額度。改用本裝置的聲音則免費且可離線使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each digest and podcast sends a few requests to your AI provider. Google Gemini’s free tier covers it; other providers bill per request." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每份摘要和播客会向你的 AI 提供商发送几次请求。Google Gemini 的免费额度可覆盖；其他提供商按请求计费。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每份摘要和播客會向你的 AI 供應商發送幾次請求。Google Gemini 的免費額度可涵蓋；其他供應商按請求計費。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each item keeps its most recent edit. A chat you cleared on one device stays cleared on the others." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个项目都保留最近一次的修改。在一台设备上清除的聊天，在其他设备上也会保持清除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
