            "value" : "每個項目都保留最近一次的修改。在一台裝置上清除的聊天，在其他裝置上也會保持清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each search or topic read is one step. More steps can find better answers but take longer and cost more. Default: %lld." : {
