    "On Google AI Studio’s free tier, Google may use what you send to improve its products, and people may review it. A paid key or Vertex AI doesn’t allow this." : {
      "comment" : "AI data consent: Google Gemini's free-tier data use",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 Google AI Studio 免费层级时，Google 可能会用你发送的内容改进其产品，并可能由人工审阅。付费密钥或 Vertex AI 不允许这样做。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 Google AI Studio 免費方案時，Google 可能會用你傳送的內容改進其產品，並可能由人工審閱。付費金鑰或 Vertex AI 不允許這樣做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Vertex AI, your Google Cloud agreement decides how Google may use what you send." : {
      "comment" : "Voice consent: data use on Vertex AI",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Vertex AI 上，Google 如何使用你发送的内容由你的 Google Cloud 协议决定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Vertex AI 上，Google 如何使用你傳送的內容由你的 Google Cloud 合約決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On any topic, open ⋯ › Report or block to report a post or user, or to hide everything a user posts. Reports are reviewed within 24 hours and offending content is removed from the app." : {
      "comment" : "Terms of Use summary row; ⋯ is the browser's More menu",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在任何话题中，打开 ⋯ › 举报或屏蔽，即可举报帖子或用户，或隐藏某个用户发布的全部内容。举报会在 24 小时内处理，违规内容会从 App 中移除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在任何話題中，打開 ⋯ › 檢舉或封鎖，即可檢舉貼文或使用者，或隱藏某位使用者發佈的全部內容。檢舉會在 24 小時內處理，違規內容會從 App 中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the free tier of Google AI Studio, Google may use what you send to improve its products, and people may review it." : {
      "comment" : "Podcast consent: Google's free-tier data use",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Google AI Studio 免费层级中，Google 可能会用你发送的内容改进其产品，也可能有人工审阅。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Google AI Studio 免費方案中，Google 可能會用你傳送的內容改進其產品，也可能有人工審閱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the free tier of Google AI Studio, Google may use what you send to improve its products, and people may review it. Don’t say or open anything you want to keep private." : {
